      "name": "Anushree HL",
      "created_at": "2026-01-06T05:56:11.241Z",
      "cooked": "<p>On Site A, Journal Entry Entry Type dropdown shows:</p>\n<p>Reversal Of ITC</p>\n<p>Reclaim of ITC Reversal</p>\n<p>On Site B (same version), the option “Reclaim of ITC Reversal” is missing</p>\n<p>I have attached a screenshot from Site A for reference.</p>\n<p>I understand that:</p>\n<p>ERPNext core supports Reversal Of ITC</p>\n<p>But Reclaim of ITC Reversal does not seem to be documented clearly</p>\n<p>My questions:</p>\n<p>What is the recommended standard approach for reclaiming reversed ITC in ERPNext?<br>\nAny settings required for this?</p>\n<p>ERPNext Version: 15.93.2</p>\n<p>Any clarification from the core team or community would be very helpful.</p>\n<p>Thanks In Advance!</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/7/274736921262c36925b3abe4a0e42d326601b3cd.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/274736921262c36925b3abe4a0e42d326601b3cd\" title=\"Screenshot (2)\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/7/274736921262c36925b3abe4a0e42d326601b3cd_2_496x500.png\" alt=\"Screenshot (2)\" data-base62-sha1=\"5Btc50SIHrSiPvWnix6dfBHNH5z\" width=\"496\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/7/274736921262c36925b3abe4a0e42d326601b3cd_2_496x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/7/274736921262c36925b3abe4a0e42d326601b3cd_2_744x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/7/274736921262c36925b3abe4a0e42d326601b3cd.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E7E7E7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot (2)</span><span class=\"informations\">912×919 49.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
